    "required_age": "17",
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/a1d4d41c541f5a038d36f5cb2e2950ff.poster.avif?t=1753801604\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/a1d4d41c541f5a038d36f5cb2e2950ff.webm?t=1753801604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/a1d4d41c541f5a038d36f5cb2e2950ff.mp4?t=1753801604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a secret laboratory after a failed experiment, Peter awakens amidst unspeakable horrors. Mutant abominations roam the corridors, relentless soldiers hunt him down, and a deadly infection silently spreads through his body \u2014 shaping him into the perfect bioweapon... or at least, that was the plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Plague Genesis&quot;</i> is a pixel art horror game featuring a sequential story, with the possibility of an alternate ending if the player makes the wrong decision. The gameplay combines puzzles, psychological horror, dynamic cutscenes, and brutal gore scenes, all while delivering an engaging narrative through dialogue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and elaborate story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzle-solving and survival mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/1f9ecf60ae128d103433e867ce136fe9.poster.avif?t=1753801604\" width=428 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/1f9ecf60ae128d103433e867ce136fe9.webm?t=1753801604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/1f9ecf60ae128d103433e867ce136fe9.mp4?t=1753801604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/a1d4d41c541f5a038d36f5cb2e2950ff.poster.avif?t=1753801604\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/a1d4d41c541f5a038d36f5cb2e2950ff.webm?t=1753801604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/a1d4d41c541f5a038d36f5cb2e2950ff.mp4?t=1753801604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a secret laboratory after a failed experiment, Peter awakens amidst unspeakable horrors. Mutant abominations roam the corridors, relentless soldiers hunt him down, and a deadly infection silently spreads through his body \u2014 shaping him into the perfect bioweapon... or at least, that was the plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Plague Genesis&quot;</i> is a pixel art horror game featuring a sequential story, with the possibility of an alternate ending if the player makes the wrong decision. The gameplay combines puzzles, psychological horror, dynamic cutscenes, and brutal gore scenes, all while delivering an engaging narrative through dialogue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and elaborate story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzle-solving and survival mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/1f9ecf60ae128d103433e867ce136fe9.poster.avif?t=1753801604\" width=428 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/1f9ecf60ae128d103433e867ce136fe9.webm?t=1753801604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704080/extras/1f9ecf60ae128d103433e867ce136fe9.mp4?t=1753801604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In Plague Genesis, Peter wakes up in a secret laboratory after a failed experiment. Surrounded by monsters and soldiers, he fights to survive while a deadly infection transforms him into the perfect biological weapon... or into the nightmare no one anticipated.",
